type":"TEXT","id":"","nodes":[],"textData":{"text":", ","decorations":[]}},{"type":"TEXT","id":"","nodes":[],"textData":{"text":"Game of Thrones","decorations":[{"type":"BOLD","fontWeightValue":700}]}},{"type":"TEXT","id":"","nodes":[],"textData":{"text":", ","decorations":[]}},{"type":"TEXT","id":"","nodes":[],"textData":{"text":"Mirzapur","decorations":[{"type":"BOLD","fontWeightValue":700}]}},{"type":"TEXT","id":"","nodes":[],"textData":{"text":", and others, each acclaimed for their storytelling and impact on digital entertainment.","decorations":[]}}],"paragraphData":{"textStyle":{"textAlignment":"AUTO"},"indentation":0}},{"type":"PARAGRAPH","id":"1q7fr13257","nodes":[],"paragraphData":{"textStyle":{"textAlignment":"AUTO"},"indentation":0}},{"type":"PARAGRAPH","id":"c2vk36394","nodes":[{"type":"TEXT","id":"","nodes":[],"textData":{"text":"Question: How are the web series rated?","decorations":[{"type":"COLOR","colorData":{"foreground":"inherit"}},{"type":"BOLD","fontWeightValue":700},{"type":"ITALIC","italicData":true}]}},{"type":"TEXT","id":"","nodes":[],"textData":{"text":" ","decorations":[{"type":"COLOR","colorData":{"foreground":"inherit"}},{"type":"ITALIC","italicData":true}]}}],"paragraphData":{"textStyle":{"textAlignment":"AUTO"},"indentation":0}},{"type":"PARAGRAPH","id":"zxxrm14972","nodes":[{"type":"TEXT","id":"","nodes":[],"textData":{"text":"Answer:","decorations":[{"type":"COLOR","colorData":{"foreground":"inherit"}},{"type":"BOLD","fontWeightValue":700}]}},{"type":"TEXT","id":"","nodes":[],"textData":{"text":" The ratings mentioned are ","decorations":[{"type":"COLOR","colorData":{"foreground":"inherit"}}]}},{"type":"TEXT","id":"","nodes":[],"textData":{"text":"IMDb scores","decorations":[{"type":"COLOR","colorData":{"foreground":"inherit"}},{"type":"BOLD","fontWeightValue":700}]}},{"type":"TEXT","id":"","nodes":[],"textData":{"text":", which are based on user reviews and may vary over time","decorations":[{"type":"COLOR","colorData":{"foreground":"inherit"}}]}}],"paragraphData":{"textStyle":{"textAlignment":"AUTO"},"indentation":0}},{"type":"PARAGRAPH","id":"7eu9x116","nodes":[],"paragraphData":{"textStyle":{"textAlignment":"AUTO"},"indentation":0}}],"metadata":{"version":1,"createdTimestamp":"2024-07-17T20:07:17.794Z","updatedTimestamp":"2024-07-17T20:07:17.794Z","id":"26f9c0b1-3d43-45d9-a576-8944b873d4bf"},"documentStyle":{}},"contentText":"In the thriving world of Internet television, captivating narratives, intricate characters, and addictive content are being brought to life, keeping viewers engaged during weekends or long holiday nights. Whether you are a seasoned enthusiast or a newcomer to this platform, here are some top web series that have made a lasting impact: Breaking Bad (2008–2013) Genre:  Crime, Drama, Thriller Synopsis:  A chemist instructor, having tried hard to cope with the fact that he has a disease which might take his life any time soon, prefers to put family first to be their protector from poverty and to provide for their basic needs.  The enthralling plot, spectacular acting, along with the ethical quandaries, reinforces “Breaking Bad” as a show that remains embedded in viewer’s memory. IMDb Rating:  9.5 Game of Thrones (2011–2019) Genre:  Action, Adventure, Drama Synopsis:  Nine clans of noble families compete for control over the homeland of Westeros where an age-old mass murderer arouses again from his long dormancy.  After all, who could forget this ground-breaking show, quite comprehensive in every respect, starting from the complicated and adventurous plot to the epic battles and extraordinary characters? IMDb Rating:  9.2 Mirzapur (2018– ) Genre:  Action, Crime, Drama Synopsis:  Through this fateful wedding procession race, has been blown up and two families have been merged into the gate opener of Mirzapur city.  This gritty series not only features power struggles, loyalty, and revenge, but it also touches on themes such as moral and ethical questions. IMDb Rating:  8.5 The Boys (2019– ) Genre:  Action, Comedy, Crime Synopsis:  A band of spirited ones decides to reveal superman-hood abusers responsible for abusing their powers. With dark humor, subversive twist regarding the superhero stereotypes as well as mind-boggling battles, “The Boys” is the one that is thriving in the genre. IMDb Rating:  8.7 Daredevil (2015–2018) Genre:  Action, Crime, Drama Synopsis:  During the day, a lawyer-turned blind man; and at night, a vigilante sent to fight crime in New York City. “Daredevil” embeds exciting plot into the character-taught story. IMDb Rating:  8.6 The Walking Dead (2010–2022) Genre:  Drama, Horror, Thriller Synopsis:  Deputy Sheriff Rick Grimes awakens from a coma and realizes the world has been overtaken by zombies.  Struggle of his survival and leadership lay the basis of the series. IMDb Rating:  8.1 Sacred Games (2018–2019) Genre:  Action, Crime, Drama Synopsis:  A brutally straightforward police officer, who has ties to a group of fugitives from the Mumbai underworld, is forced to save the city from impending annihilation.  The series achieves this through brilliant acting and an addictive storyline, thereby becoming an indispensable view. IMDb Rating:  8.5 Afsos (2020– ) Genre:  Comedy, Drama Synopsis:  Immortality is where a suicidal man and deadly assassin happen to collide with each other.  This black-comedy suspense thriller keeps the audience guessing and hypothesizing. IMDb Rating:  7.5 Breathe (2018) Genre:  Crime, Drama, Thriller Synopsis: How far will you go to keep the one you love?  Two men, on the brink of the abyss, start chasing each other in order to protect their precious ones. The movie “Breathe” is full of tensions and emotions. IMDb Rating:  8.3 The Family Man (2019- ) Genre:  Action, Comedy, Drama Synopsis:  A working man from the National Investigation Agency has to reconcile between the task of dealing with terrorism to secure the nation and keeping his family safe from his work shrouded in secrecy.  An amazing mixture of action and family drama. IMDb Rating:  8.7 Keep in mind, though, that people are different and there are other great web series that you don’t want to miss.  Discover, explore, and enter the exciting new world of digital storytelling! Disclaimer:  IMDb scores are based on users' tastes and thus may vary from time to time. FAQs Question: What is the focus of the article?  Answer: The article lists the top 10 best web series ever produced , providing a brief synopsis, genre, and IMDb rating for each series. Question: Which web series are featured?  Answer:  The list includes popular series like Breaking Bad , Game of Thrones , Mirzapur , and others, each acclaimed for their storytelling and impact on digital entertainment. Question: How are the web series rated?  Answer:  The ratings mentioned are IMDb scores , which are based on user reviews and may vary over time"}